      <div class="case-study-panel fade-up">
        <div class="case-study-header">
          <div class="case-study-title-group">
            <div class="case-study-label">Case Study 002</div>
            <div class="case-study-name">Nexus Flow OS — Multi-Branch Fuel &amp; Business Operations Platform</div>
          </div>
          <div class="case-live-badge amber">
            <div class="case-live-dot amber"></div>
            <span>In Active Development · Pilot Open</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="case-study-body">

          <!-- Col 1: Brief & Challenge -->
          <div class="case-col">
            <div class="case-col-label">Brief &amp; Challenge</div>
            <div class="case-item">Fuel retailers running multiple branches lack real-time visibility into shift-level cash, stock, and variance — most still rely on paper dip books and end-of-day reconciliation.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Attendant handovers and cash drops needed a live, auditable trail instead of a manual book checked once per shift.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Mobile money is now a standard payment method at the pump — the platform needed native support for the two dominant Zambian rails, not a bolt-on.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Architecture had to accommodate stations at very different maturity levels — from fully manual dip readings to future forecourt hardware integration — without a rebuild.</div>
            <div class="case-col-label" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Tech Stack</div>
            <div class="case-stack">
              <span class="stack-pill">Next.js</span>
              <span class="stack-pill">TypeScript</span>
              <span class="stack-pill">FastAPI</span>
              <span class="stack-pill">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="stack-pill">Redis</span>
              <span class="stack-pill">Docker</span>
              <span class="stack-pill">nginx</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Col 2: Solution -->
          <div class="case-col" style="background:rgba(10,22,40,0.6);">
            <div class="case-col-label">Solution &amp; Execution</div>
            <div class="case-item">Built a flexible Nozzle model that replaces hardcoded pump-meter columns — the same schema scales from a single-pump site to a multi-branch network.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Designed a timezone-aware dynamic shift-boundary and dip-reading gate system, so shift handovers are enforced by the platform rather than trusted to a paper log.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Implemented self-healing inventory reconciliation with threshold-based variance detection, automatically flagging incidents instead of waiting for a manual month-end review.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Added a mobile money payment modal for attendants covering Airtel and MTN — the two payment rails already in daily use at Zambian filling stations.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Built an executive dashboard showing true gross margin with fuel cost factored in, plus a branch-scoped finance page for revenue and expense tracking.</div>
            <div class="case-item">Containerized the full stack with Docker Compose and nginx for consistent, repeatable deployment across branch sites.</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Col 3: Results -->
          <div class="case-col">
            <div class="case-col-label">Deliverables &amp; Status</div>
            <div class="case-result">
              <span class="case-result-icon">✅</span>
              <div class="case-result-text"><strong>Shift &amp; Dip Workflow</strong>Dynamic shift boundaries, gated dip-reading entry</div>
            </div>
            <div class="case-result">
              <span class="case-result-icon">✅</span>
              <div class="case-result-text"><strong>Variance Detection</strong>Threshold-based incident creation, self-healing stock correction</div>
            </div>
            <div class="case-result">
              <span class="case-result-icon">✅</span>
              <div class="case-result-text"><strong>Mobile Money Payments</strong>Airtel &amp; MTN payment capture for attendants</div>
            </div>
